省电费，晚上不开灯——用手机闪光灯照着吃饭！\n[s2]那不得晃瞎眼？\n[s1]人家说了：“这叫沉浸式烛光晚餐，还不用洗蜡烛台！”\n[s6]所以啊，年轻人要理性消费！\n[s1]您先解释下，为啥公司年会奖品是——“老板签名版《高效能人士的七个习惯》”？\n[s3]还附赠一句话：“看完了来我办公室谈感想。”\n[s4]这哪是奖品？这是KPI续命丹！\n[s1]其实啊，不是年轻人不想花，是工资追不上套路。\n[s1]省，不是抠，是被生活逼成了精算师。\n[s1]但再省，也得留点钱——\n[s2]留点钱干啥？\n[s1]留点钱，给将来治颈椎病啊！天天低头看工资条，脖子都快断了！\n[s1]（叹气，拉长音）哎——！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [531.0996704101562, 877.0728149414062], "pos": [-72.32185363769531, 138.06710815429688], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [25], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["be16d7e98d7a106f784afa47b70d25e2a1075fe6a595ad0696176f5040ffe4d7.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "LoadAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [270, 136], "pos": [-639.7709350585938, 874.8316650390625], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [34], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["edb9dfc80a411923a64ecfe4007ced041f0564d5fe27557ce2543610946c524d.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "fla